# Written by `deno check` (npm run typecheck:api) whenever the API boundary is
# checked locally. It is a byproduct of running the checker, not source: the
# edge functions pin their own versions in the import specifiers themselves
# (`jsr:@supabase/supabase-js@2.49.8`), and the Supabase CLI resolves them at
# deploy time. Committing this would newly pin dependency resolution for the
# deploy — a production change, and not one type-checking needs.
supabase/functions/deno.lock
